    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy is delighted to introduce this stunning, 'A' rated, three-bedroom family home to the market, complete with a fantastic attic conversion and freshly painted throughout. Located in the highly sought-after, family-friendly development of Beresford, this contemporary property is in exceptional condition, boasting bright, spacious interiors and a thoughtful design. Situated close to a playground and just minutes from the scenic Newbridge Park & Demesne, it's the perfect setting for a growing family.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a home that has been lovingly enhanced over the years, offering well-proportioned accommodation of approximately 133 sq. m. The 'A' energy rating ensures excellent heating and electrical efficiency, keeping running costs to a minimum. The ground floor features a bright entrance hall with beautiful wooden floors that lead to a large, open-plan kitchen, dining, and family area, with French doors opening onto the West facing rear garden. A practical utility room and a guest WC are conveniently located just off the kitchen. The ground floor is completed by a generous living room, featuring bespoke built in units and a stove, perfect for relaxing evenings.\n\nUpstairs, the home provides a comfortable master bedroom with a private en-suite and built-in wardrobes. There are also two additional bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a main family bathroom. The attic has been cleverly converted into a spacious room with extendable Velux windows and ample storage, providing a versatile space and a separate home office, ideal for working from home.\n\nThe property's rear garden is a private oasis, with a wide side entrance and a lean-to for extra storage. To the front, a driveway provides private parking.\n\nThis home is situated in a quiet cul-de-sac. t is within walking distance of Donabate village, which offers a variety of amenities and clubs for golf, tennis, football, and hockey. Local attractions like Newbridge House and Farm and Donabate Beach are also nearby.\n\nDonabate village is a bustling hub with an excellent selection of shops and services, including a Supervalu, Post Office, pharmacies, and two public houses. Excellent public transport links, including a nearby train station and bus routes 33B & 33D, provide easy access to the M1/M50 network and Dublin Airport.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this stunning home."
      },
